OL,4,CCharity Santa ride gears up for its    
OL,5,C20th year                              
OL,6,GA charity motorcycle Santa ride is     
OL,7,Ggearing up for its 20th year, with 160 
OL,8,Griders aiming to delight onlookers     
OL,9,Gwith their costumes, music and the     
OL,10,Groaring of engines.                    
OL,12,FThe Boundary 500 Motorcycle Santa ride 
OL,13,Fwill follow its 22mile (35km) route    
OL,14,Ffrom Thornaby to Kirkleatham Hall near 
OL,15,FRedcar on Saturday.                    
OL,17,FFounder Brian Laverick, 75, said they  
OL,18,Fwere hoping to raise the #23,000       
OL,19,Fneeded to reach #500,000 in total      
OL,20,Fdonations for Middlesbrough-based      
OL,21,FZoe's Place, adding the event meant    
OL,22,F"so much to so many people".      G1/4 
