OL,4,CRock stars sign guitar to fund nature  
OL,5,Cscheme                                 
OL,6,GA guitar signed by Sir Paul McCartney, 
OL,7,GSam Fender and Sting is set to be      
OL,8,Gauctioned off to raise money for a     
OL,9,Gnature restoration project.            
OL,11,FThe instrument, which has also has the 
OL,12,Fautographs of Dire Straits star Mark   
OL,13,FKnopfler and Grammy Award nominee Joan 
OL,14,FArmatrading, is being sold to help     
OL,15,Ffund work at the Rothbury Estate in    
OL,16,FNorthumberland.                        
OL,18,FThe Wildlife Trusts and Northumberland 
OL,19,FWildlife Trust purchased the land      
OL,20,Fafter raising #30m to buy it from the  
OL,21,Fson of the Duke of Northumberland,     
OL,22,FLord Max Percy.                   G2/4 
